{"title":"Career roadmap · Design Assistant","role":"Design Assistant","summary":"A Design Assistant supports interior designers and design teams with concept development, drawings, material selection, 3D visualisation, documentation, presentations and project coordination.","facts":{"Starts":"2026","Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Interior Design (B.Sc)","Timeline assumption":"This roadmap assumes a 3-year B.Sc route, with an optional 4-year honours/research year. The strongest entry profile combines design fundamentals with CAD, 3D modelling, visualisation, materials knowledge, working drawings and a professional portfolio."},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build design fundamentals, drafting, CAD, 3D modelling, materials and presentation skills; target Design Assistant, Junior Interior Designer, CAD Assistant or 3D Visualiser roles."},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Specialise in residential, commercial, hospitality, retail, workplace or sustainable interior design."},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Progress toward Interior Designer, Senior Interior Designer, Design Coordinator, Visualisation Specialist or Project Designer."},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Combine spatial design with BIM, parametric design, AI-assisted visualisation, sustainable materials, smart interiors and project management."}],"sections":[{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026 H2"},{"text":"Design principles, colour, composition, proportion and space planning"},{"text":"Autodesk Design Resources","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/"},{"text":"5 hand-drawn space-planning exercises"},{"text":"Design foundation"}],[{"text":"2027 H1"},{"text":"Technical drafting, floor plans, elevations and sections"},{"text":"Autodesk AutoCAD","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/products/autocad/overview"},{"text":"Complete a residential drawing set"},{"text":"Technical drawing"}],[{"text":"2027 H2"},{"text":"SketchUp/3D modelling and spatial visualisation"},{"text":"SketchUp Campus","url":"https://learn.sketchup.com/"},{"text":"Model a complete room/interior"},{"text":"3D skills"}],[{"text":"2028 H1"},{"text":"Materials, finishes, furniture and lighting"},{"text":"Autodesk Design Resources","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/"},{"text":"Create a material and furniture specification board"},{"text":"Material knowledge"}],[{"text":"2028 H2"},{"text":"Rendering and visual presentation"},{"text":"Blender","url":"https://www.blender.org/"},{"text":"Produce 3–5 photorealistic/interior renders"},{"text":"Visualisation"}],[{"text":"2029 H1"},{"text":"BIM and professional construction documentation"},{"text":"Autodesk Revit","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/products/revit/overview"},{"text":"Create a small BIM interior project"},{"text":"BIM"}],[{"text":"2029 H2"},{"text":"Internship + professional portfolio"},{"text":"AICTE Internship Portal","url":"https://internship.aicte-india.org/"},{"text":"Internship + 8–12 strong portfolio projects"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"2029–30"},{"text":"Advanced design/research project for honours route"},{"text":"National Institute of Design","url":"https://www.nid.edu/"},{"text":"Major interior/spatial-design project"},{"text":"Research/design depth"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"4-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the additional year for a substantial project such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable residential interior"},{"text":"Hospitality interior"},{"text":"Retail-store design"},{"text":"Workplace design"},{"text":"Universal/accessibility-focused interior"},{"text":"Smart-home interior"},{"text":"Adaptive reuse project"},{"text":"Sustainable-material study"},{"text":"BIM-based interior project"},{"text":"Interior-design research project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation lanes"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Residential Interior Design"},{"text":"AutoCAD, SketchUp, materials, space planning"},{"text":"Autodesk AutoCAD","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/products/autocad/overview"},{"text":"Senior Interior Designer"}],[{"text":"Commercial / Workplace Design"},{"text":"AutoCAD, Revit, BIM, space planning"},{"text":"Autodesk Revit","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/products/revit/overview"},{"text":"Workplace Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Hospitality Design"},{"text":"3D, materials, lighting, FF&E, guest experience"},{"text":"Institute of Hospitality","url":"https://www.instituteofhospitality.org/"},{"text":"Hospitality Design Lead"}],[{"text":"3D Visualisation"},{"text":"Blender, rendering, modelling, composition"},{"text":"Blender","url":"https://www.blender.org/"},{"text":"3D Visualisation Specialist"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Interiors"},{"text":"Sustainable materials, energy, daylighting, circular design"},{"text":"U.S. Green Building Council","url":"https://www.usgbc.org/"},{"text":"Sustainable Design Specialist"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Evolve/stay relevant, 2035–2046","text":"Add BIM, computational/parametric design, AI-assisted visualisation, sustainable materials, digital fabrication, smart-building systems and project-management skills. Keep the portfolio current rather than relying only on software certificates."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public-sector routes"},{"type":"table","header":["Route","Who can apply","Pay and cost","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"National Institute of Design"},{"text":"Eligibility varies by programme/opportunity"},{"text":"Check the official site"},{"text":"National Institute of Design","url":"https://www.nid.edu/"}],[{"text":"CPWD design/architecture ecosystem"},{"text":"Eligibility depends on current opportunity"},{"text":"Check the official site"},{"text":"CPWD","url":"https://cpwd.gov.in/"}],[{"text":"HUDCO / built-environment opportunities"},{"text":"Eligibility varies by current programme"},{"text":"Check the official site"},{"text":"HUDCO","url":"https://hudco.org.in/"}],[{"text":"AICTE Internship Portal"},{"text":"Students meeting individual internship requirements"},{"text":"Fee/stipend varies"},{"text":"AICTE Internship Portal","url":"https://internship.aicte-india.org/"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private / professional routes"},{"type":"table","header":["Route","What it is","Cost and timing","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"Interior design studios"},{"text":"Residential and commercial design exposure"},{"text":"Employer-specific"},{"text":"LinkedIn Jobs","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/"}],[{"text":"Architecture/design firms"},{"text":"Drawings, documentation and spatial-design projects"},{"text":"Employer-specific"},{"text":"ArchDaily Jobs","url":"https://www.archdaily.com/jobs"}],[{"text":"Furniture/interior brands"},{"text":"Materials, furniture, styling and customer projects"},{"text":"Employer-specific"},{"text":"LinkedIn Jobs","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/"}],[{"text":"Design competitions/projects"},{"text":"Portfolio-building design work"},{"text":"Usually project-dependent"},{"text":"ArchDaily","url":"https://www.archdaily.com/"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Eligibility note","text":"Design internships commonly require a portfolio, software knowledge and availability for studio/site work. Individual firms may specify different academic and software requirements."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning route","Cost","When to take it","Why it helps","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"Autodesk AutoCAD certification"},{"text":"Paid; current fee: check the official site"},{"text":"2nd year"},{"text":"Validates CAD capability"},{"text":"Autodesk Certification","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/certification/overview"}],[{"text":"Autodesk Revit certification"},{"text":"Paid; current fee: check the official site"},{"text":"3rd year"},{"text":"Useful for BIM-oriented roles"},{"text":"Autodesk Certification","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/certification/overview"}],[{"text":"SketchUp learning/certification"},{"text":"Provider-dependent"},{"text":"2nd year"},{"text":"3D modelling and spatial visualisation"},{"text":"SketchUp Campus","url":"https://learn.sketchup.com/"}],[{"text":"LEED Green Associate"},{"text":"Paid; current fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Final year / early career"},{"text":"Useful for sustainable-design work"},{"text":"USGBC LEED","url":"https://www.usgbc.org/credentials/leed-green-associate"}],[{"text":"Blender training"},{"text":"Software free; courses vary"},{"text":"2nd–3rd year"},{"text":"Rendering and 3D visualisation"},{"text":"Blender","url":"https://www.blender.org/"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Fee note","text":"Certification fees and examination rules change. Confirm current pricing and eligibility on the official provider website."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"First-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Interior Designer"},{"text":"Interior Design Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Space Planner"},{"text":"CAD Designer"},{"text":"CAD Assistant"},{"text":"3D Visualiser"},{"text":"Interior Styling Assistant"},{"text":"Design Coordinator"},{"text":"Furniture/Material Design Assistant"},{"text":"FF&E Assistant"},{"text":"Design Documentation Assistant"}]},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Design Assistant"},{"text":"AutoCAD, SketchUp, drawings, presentations"},{"text":"Design portfolio"}],[{"text":"Junior Interior Designer"},{"text":"Space planning, materials, CAD, 3D"},{"text":"Complete interior project"}],[{"text":"CAD Assistant"},{"text":"AutoCAD, technical drawings, dimensions"},{"text":"Residential drawing set"}],[{"text":"3D Visualiser"},{"text":"Blender/3D software, rendering, composition"},{"text":"Render portfolio"}],[{"text":"Space Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Floor plans, ergonomics, circulation"},{"text":"Space-planning project"}],[{"text":"Design Coordinator"},{"text":"Documentation, communication, project tracking"},{"text":"Internship + project documentation"}],[{"text":"FF&E Assistant"},{"text":"Furniture, finishes, specifications, vendor research"},{"text":"Material/FF&E schedule"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Check live design-firm job postings before deciding which software to prioritise."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Route","Entrance exam and timing","Who can apply","Examples of colleges","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Des"},{"text":"Institute-specific / NID-DAT where applicable"},{"text":"Relevant bachelor's graduates; eligibility varies"},{"text":"National Institute of Design"},{"text":"NID","url":"https://www.nid.edu/"}],[{"text":"M.Des through IIT design schools"},{"text":"CEED, usually conducted annually"},{"text":"Degree-specific eligibility"},{"text":"IIT Bombay, IIT Delhi, IIT Guwahati and other participating institutes"},{"text":"CEED","url":"https://www.ceed.iitb.ac.in/"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Interior / Spatial Design"},{"text":"Institution-specific"},{"text":"Relevant bachelor's degree"},{"text":"Check current programme availability"},{"text":"Check the official site"}],[{"text":"Master's in Architecture/Interior-related fields"},{"text":"Institution-specific"},{"text":"Eligibility varies significantly"},{"text":"University-specific"},{"text":"Check the official site"}],[{"text":"MBA Design / Project Management"},{"text":"CAT/CMAT/MAT or institution-specific"},{"text":"Eligible bachelor's graduates"},{"text":"Management institutions"},{"text":"CAT","url":"https://iimcat.ac.in/"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Scholarships / fellowships"},{"type":"note","label":"UGC scholarships/fellowships","text":"eligibility depends on the specific scheme. UGC"},{"type":"note","label":"Institute-specific scholarships","text":"check the individual design school."},{"type":"note","label":"NID financial assistance","text":"verify the current institute rules."},{"type":"note","label":"PMRF","text":"not a standard route for interior design and not a normal direct route after a 3-year B.Sc. PMRF"},{"type":"note","label":"Sponsorship note","text":"Design firms may sponsor selected professional training, but postgraduate sponsorship is employer-specific."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Royal College of Art, University of the Arts London, Kingston University"},{"text":"Chevening / university scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio, degree equivalence and English"}],[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Pratt Institute, Parsons School of Design, Rhode Island School of Design"},{"text":"Institutional scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio, academic requirements and English"}],[{"text":"Italy"},{"text":"Politecnico di Milano, IED"},{"text":"University/institutional scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio, academic background and language"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"RMIT University, University of Technology Sydney"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Portfolio, academic requirements and English"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Design Academy Eindhoven, TU Delft"},{"text":"University scholarships / Erasmus Mundus where applicable"},{"text":"Programme-specific portfolio and academic requirements"}],[{"text":"Europe"},{"text":"Multiple design schools"},{"text":"Erasmus Mundus where applicable"},{"text":"Consortium-specific requirements"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Erasmus Mundus Joint Masters\nChevening\nDAAD","url":"https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/opportunities-for-individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters"},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"Degree/provisional certificate"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"2–3 recommendation letters"},{"text":"English-language test if required"},{"text":"Design portfolio"},{"text":"Technical drawings"},{"text":"3D models/renders"},{"text":"Material boards"},{"text":"Design process sketches"},{"text":"Research/project documentation"},{"text":"Passport"},{"text":"Financial documents where required"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For design programmes, the portfolio is often one of the most important parts of the application. Show the design process, not only final renders."},{"type":"h","text":"Visa / job-offer note"},{"type":"p","text":"Student-visa rules, post-study work rights and employment conditions vary by country. Check the destination government's current immigration rules before applying."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Interior Design","Design Intern","Design Assistant / Junior Interior Designer (0–2 years)","Interior Designer / 3D Visualiser / Space Planner (2–5 years)","Senior Interior Designer / Design Lead (5–8 years)","Design Manager / Project Designer (8–12 years)","Associate Design Director / Studio Lead (12–16 years)","Design Director / Creative Director (16+ years)"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior and spatial design"},{"text":"Sustainable interior environments"},{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Environmental psychology"},{"text":"Universal/accessibility design"},{"text":"Material innovation"},{"text":"Circular design"},{"text":"Smart interiors"},{"text":"Lighting design"},{"text":"Workplace design"},{"text":"Hospitality design"},{"text":"Digital fabrication"},{"text":"Computational design"},{"text":"Spatial experience and wellbeing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term designer should move beyond producing drawings and renders into design leadership and strategic spatial design. Build expertise in BIM, computational design, sustainable materials, AI-assisted visualisation, smart interiors, digital fabrication and project management. A strong portfolio, client-management ability and understanding of construction will remain important even as visualisation becomes increasingly automated."},{"type":"p","text":"Do you want to add anything else to tailor this?"}]}]}